reports on and a local receiver answering the start report with 500 sent
the start report and nothing to error_reports. After: the same run sent one
error report ("telling JusPrin's server that the app started", HTTP 500 and
the receiver's answer); with reports off it sent none; with no receiver it
sent none and logged "reached no server", and no run queued a dialog. The new
jusprin_update_tests case failed before and passes (17 cases).
